        {
          "id": 1341110535,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Why? There are various types of extension interfaces to Wireshark:\n- Filetype\n- Codec\n- Dissector\n- Extcap\n\nAll these are identified as 'plugin' interface.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2398962,
            "username": "JaapKeuter",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jaap Keuter",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/722b0c520542a23cb8f8ea7070a45c88f9e9214dc700ac151e419e9649e0304e?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/JaapKeuter"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-04-04T17:14:19.611Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-04-04T17:28:58.936Z",
