        {
          "id": 1342211837,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I meant in general, plug-ins are small binaries loaded dynamically, we have terms like extensions and add-ons to describe other mechanisms, but I'll agree that that definition of plug-in is not universally followed or agreed upon.",
